## Summary
KT SAT has controlled satellites at a geostationary altitude of 36,000 km for 32 years and is now entering low Earth orbit operations, marking a new technological challenge. This expansion highlights advancements in satellite management capabilities.

## Key Points
- KT SAT has 32 years of experience in controlling geostationary satellites.
- The company is initiating operations in low Earth orbit satellites.
- This move represents a strategic shift in satellite technology.


